  "post_title": "Se traslada al sábado el toro embolado de esta noche en el Barri de Sant Pere de Onda",
  "post_date": "2014-07-03 16:45:46",
  "post_name": "se-traslada-al-sabado-el-toro-embolado-de-esta-noche-en-el-barri-de-sant-pere-de-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">La lluvia ca&iacute;da a partir de mediod&iacute;a de este jueves en Onda ha provocado varios cambios en los actos festivos del Barri de Sant Pere. La comida para la Tercera Edad se ha trasladado a ma&ntilde;ana viernes y esta noche no se embolar&aacute; el toro cerril, que pasa al s&aacute;bado.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_8543.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La noche de este mi&eacute;rcoles s&iacute; que se ha podido celebrar la fiesta de la espuma y ha estado muy animada. Esta tarde s&oacute;lo habr&aacute; exhibici&oacute;n de vaquillas de la ganader&iacute;a Hermanos Guillam&oacute;n de Sant Joan de Mor&oacute;. Por la noche, si el tiempo no lo impide, se embolar&aacute; un toro de este corro, a las 23.30 horas.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El toro cerril previsto para esta tarde, de la ganader&iacute;a de La Victoria, se exhibir&aacute; y embolar&aacute; la tarde y la noche del s&aacute;bado 5 de julio.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8527.jpg\" alt=\"img_8527\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8529.jpg\" alt=\"img_8529\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8530.jpg\" alt=\"img_8530\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8531.jpg\" alt=\"img_8531\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8532.jpg\" alt=\"img_8532\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8533.jpg\" alt=\"img_8533\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8534.jpg\" alt=\"img_8534\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8535.jpg\" alt=\"img_8535\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8536.jpg\" alt=\"img_8536\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8538.jpg\" alt=\"img_8538\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8540.jpg\" alt=\"img_8540\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8541.jpg\" alt=\"img_8541\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8543.jpg\" alt=\"img_8543\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8544.jpg\" alt=\"img_8544\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8545.jpg\" alt=\"img_8545\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8546.jpg\" alt=\"img_8546\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaescumasantpere14/img_8547.jpg\" alt=\"img_8547\" style=\"max-width:100%;